            "In your Cloudflare dashboard, open R2 Object Storage and create a bucket (for example \u201cmy-pbs-library\u201d). Keep it private: do not connect a public domain.": [
                "Cloudflare idar\u0259etm\u0259 panelinizd\u0259 R2 Object Storage b\u00f6lm\u0259sini a\u00e7\u0131n v\u0259 bir paket (m\u0259s\u0259l\u0259n, \u201cmy-pbs-library\u201d) yarad\u0131n. Onu gizli saxlay\u0131n: ictimai domen ba\u011flamay\u0131n."
            ],
            "Open \u201cManage API tokens\u201d in R2 and create an API token with \u201cObject Read & Write\u201d permission, limited to that one bucket.": [
                "R2 daxilind\u0259 \u201cAPI tokenl\u0259rini idar\u0259 et\u201d b\u00f6lm\u0259sini a\u00e7\u0131n v\u0259 h\u0259min t\u0259k paket il\u0259 m\u0259hdudla\u015fan \u201cObyekti oxu v\u0259 yaz\u201d icaz\u0259sin\u0259 malik API tokeni yarad\u0131n."
            ],
            "Copy the Access Key ID and the Secret Access Key it shows (the secret is shown only once).": [
                "G\u00f6st\u0259ril\u0259n Giri\u015f A\u00e7ar\u0131 ID-sini v\u0259 M\u0259xfi Giri\u015f A\u00e7ar\u0131n\u0131 kopyalay\u0131n (m\u0259xfi a\u00e7ar yaln\u0131z bir d\u0259f\u0259 g\u00f6st\u0259rilir)."
            ],
            "Copy the S3 endpoint for your account. It looks like https:\/\/<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Region is \u201cauto\u201d.": [
                "Hesab\u0131n\u0131z \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcn S3 endpoint kopyalay\u0131n. O, https:\/\/<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com kimi g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Region \u201cauto\u201d-dur."
            ],
            "Paste the values below, save, then press \u201cTest connection\u201d. Switch the library to your storage only when the test passes.": [
                "A\u015fa\u011f\u0131dak\u0131 d\u0259y\u0259rl\u0259ri yap\u0131\u015fd\u0131r\u0131n, yadda saxlay\u0131n, sonra \"Ba\u011flant\u0131n\u0131 yoxla\" d\u00fcym\u0259sin\u0259 bas\u0131n. Kitabxanan\u0131 yaln\u0131z s\u0131naq u\u011furla ke\u00e7dikd\u0259 yadda\u015f\u0131n\u0131za ke\u00e7irin."
            ],
            "Create a private bucket with your provider (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO or any S3-compatible service).": [
                "T\u0259chizat\u00e7\u0131n\u0131zla (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO v\u0259 ya h\u0259r hans\u0131 S3 il\u0259 uy\u011fun xidm\u0259t) \u015f\u0259xsi paket (bucket) yarad\u0131n."
            ],
            "Create an access key that can read, write and delete objects in that bucket only.": [
